{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50640","headline":"奉敕陪内宴 · 王孝廉","name":"奉敕陪内宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海国来朝自远方，百年一醉谒天裳。\n日宫座外何攸见，五色云飞万岁光。\n（见金毓黻撰集《渤海国志长编》卷十八引《文华秀丽集》上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王孝廉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50640.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50640","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}